{
  "id": "07_chinook_refine",
  "title": "Hands-On Polish: Sculpting Micro-Voxels & Custom Paint",
  "label": "勺子与画笔修补",
  "duration": 29.9,
  "voice_timing": [
    {
      "start": 0.2,
      "duration": 6.76,
      "text": "Now let's see how effortless it is to customize an AI-generated build. We switch into first-person and pause the entity to begin editing.",
      "source": "modules/07_chinook_refine/audio/146d600c6a0bc7ea04ec.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.21,
      "duration": 10.24,
      "text": "Selecting Spoon brings up a targeted reticle focused on an eighth-meter micro-voxel. We carve out a clean notch along the edge without removing a full standard block, shaping the airframe with sculptural precision.",
      "source": "modules/07_chinook_refine/audio/678cf2eea02f4867a3fb.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.7,
      "duration": 11.84,
      "text": "Switching to Brush, we pick an accent color and paint a custom livery detail. This is where Space shines: the AI handles the heavy structural engineering, and in just a few seconds with your own hands, you make the machine truly your own.",
      "source": "modules/07_chinook_refine/audio/be703f624c5271b2b7ef.wav"
    }
  ],
